<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 53,200 MT were more than four times the prior week, but 51 percent under the 4-week average.</p>
<p>Spain (21,300 MT) and Japan (18,900 MT) were the major buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 178,000 MT improved 4 percent from the previous week and 59 percent from the 4-week average.  The primary destinations were Mexico (77,900 MT) and Japan (39,700 MT).</p>
</text>
